			"notes": "In 0.9.4 i've added some visuals, as well as some gamebreaking bugs.\\\nNow when they are mostly fixed, here are the patchnotes:\n* Now player's hand corresponds to the rope direction\n* Now all hitscan stuff is based on player's shoulder, and not eyesight\n* Added nbt data to rope entitiy so it actually somewhat works in multiplayer? At least it disappears less\n* Fixed weird visual bug on 1st tick of grapple rope\n* Changed most of the sounds to be better (if you have suggestions on how to improve those, feel free to leave them in our discord's #suggestions channel)"
		},
